OL,3,GNEWSACommittee to decide on 'eyesore'
OL,4,Ahousing plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans for 200 homes on the edge of
OL,7,FMalvern that residents fear will be an
OL,8,F"eyesore" are set to be decided by
OL,9,Fcouncillors.
OL,11,FA Malvern Hills District Council
OL,12,Fplanning committee will consider the
OL,13,Freserved matters application for the
OL,14,FCales Farm development on land off
OL,15,FBroadlands Drive on Wednesday.
OL,17,FSome residents fear the development
OL,18,Fcould affect views from the Malvern
OL,19,FHills - an example of a "precious
OL,20,Fnationally-important landscape" that
OL,21,Fonly exists if protected.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,357,350,200,160,0,100
